{"id":"n60092-1-7","stage":0,"title":"건너가다 · 过","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60092-1-7-1","ko":"신호 바뀌기 전에 빨리 건너가.","zh":"在信号灯变之前，快点过马路吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"신호","meaning":"信号","explanation":"신호：信号","readings":[{"term":"신호","audio":"/audio/617aa217dbc92e8aaffc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66278","senseId":"1","lemma":"신호","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바뀌기","meaning":"改变，转变，更改","explanation":"바뀌다：改变，转变，更改；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"바뀌다","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61179","senseId":"3","lemma":"바뀌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전에","meaning":"上","explanation":"전：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17306","senseId":"2","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건너가.","meaning":"过，跨过，渡过","explanation":"건너가다：过，跨过，渡过；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"건너가다","audio":"/audio/b3d7025fea85beb2a260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60092","senseId":"1","lemma":"건너가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"617aa217dbc92e8a","term":"신호","zh":"信号","audio":"/audio/617aa217dbc92e8aaffc.mp3","entryId":"66278","definition":"为了传达某些内容而相互约定使用的特定的声音、颜色、光和身体动作等符号。","pronunciation":["신ː호"]},{"id":"5207e639323d4244","term":"바뀌다","zh":"改变，转变，更改","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3","entryId":"61179","definition":"内容或状态等变化或变样。","pronunciation":["바뀌다"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17306","definition":"时间上之前的。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"b3d7025fea85beb2","term":"건너가다","zh":"过，跨过，渡过","audio":"/audio/b3d7025fea85beb2a260.mp3","entryId":"60092","definition":"从江河或桥、道路等的一边去另一边。","pronunciation":["건ː너가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4a2b7f57a76c652809e3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60092-1-7-2","ko":"아직 파란불이니까 괜찮아.","zh":"现在还是绿灯，没问题的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"파란불이니까","meaning":"蓝；火","explanation":"파랗다：蓝；불：火；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"파랗다","audio":"/audio/27555478331997f6bc6b.mp3"},{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71306","senseId":"1","lemma":"파랗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"2","lemma":"불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"괜찮아.","meaning":"无恙，没事","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"27555478331997f6","term":"파랗다","zh":"蓝","audio":"/audio/27555478331997f6bc6b.mp3","entryId":"71306","definition":"像晴朗的秋天的天空或深邃的大海一样明亮鲜明的颜色。","pronunciation":["파ː라타"]},{"id":"05e6efdf147502fc","term":"불","zh":"火","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3","entryId":"61154","definition":"发出光亮、照亮黑暗的物体。","pronunciation":["불"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]}],"audio":"/audio/767111e6449992d69d44.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.66,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60092","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":26,"sequenceScore":1.2576,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["现在还是绿灯，没问题的。","在信号灯变之前，快点过马路吧。","浴场里有卖牙刷吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["在信号灯变之前，快点过马路吧。","浴场里有卖牙刷吗？","现在还是绿灯，没问题的。"],"answer":2}]}
